      "body": "Concept ACK, just restating some of the things said on IRC: losing compiler diversity is unfortunate but given that MSVC is closed-source, gleaning information from any problems it surfaces is difficult, and their process for dealing with internal bugs is opaque.\n\nsee e.g. https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/issues/31303 and https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/32499#issuecomment-2885771313 where e.g. it was not even clear what version fixed an internal issue. \n",
